    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d749-a1">

                <pb facs="0853" n="767" xml:id="pg767"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lazarro to Mr.
                            Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consular Agency</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Salonica</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-10-03"><hi rendition="#italic">October 3,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Many threatening insurgents crossed frontier. Serious engagement took place
                    Razlog. Many villages burning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lazarro.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
